---
layout: page.njk
title: Hexagon's Blog
tags: index
---
<section class="mb-5">
    <h1 class="mb-3 hello">Hello, I'm Hexagon</h1>
    <span class="index-avatar"><img src="/img/hexagon_150.webp" width="150" height="150" alt="Hexagon's avatar" title="Hexagon's Avatar"></span>
    <p class="lead-text">I've been into JavaScript since 1996, having created libraries like <a href="https://croner.56k.guru" target="_blank">Croner</a>, a cross-runtime cron scheduler, and <a href="https://pup.56k.guru" target="_blank">Pup</a>, a process manager similar to pm2 for Deno. My blog covers everything from JavaScript and TypeScript to modern runtimes like Deno, and lately also Rust, Linux servers, security and identity, with projects like rootcard and Murmo. I'm all about Open Source, portable code and minimal bloat.</p>
    <p>For a solid foundation in pure JavaScript, check out my article series <a href="/posts/guide-to-js/introduction/">The guide to JavaScript</a>.</p>
    <p>This blog is built using <a href="https://deno.land" target="_blank">Deno</a> and <a href="https://lume.land" target="_blank">Lume</a>, and the source code is available at <a href="https://github.com/hexagon/blog">github.com/hexagon/blog</a>.</p>
    <br>
    <hr>
    <h2 class="mb-4 mt-5 section-title">Recent posts</h2>
    <div class="post-list">
    {% for subpost in search.pages("post", "date=desc", 20) %}
           
            <section>
                <hgroup>
                    <h3 class="post-title"><a href="{{ subpost.url }}">{{ subpost.title or "title" }}</a></h3>
                    <p>
                        <!-- Author -->
                        {% if subpost.author %}
                            by <strong>{{ subpost.author.name }}</strong>, 
                        {% endif %}

                        <!-- Date -->
                        <time datetime="{{ subpost.date | date("yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:ss'.000'XX") }}">
                            {{ subpost.date | date }}</time>{% if subpost.updated %}<span>, Updated:</span>
                        <time datetime="{{ subpost.updated | date("yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:ss'.000'XX") }}">
                            {{ subpost.updated | date }}
                        </time>
                        {% endif %}
                    </p>
                </hgroup>
                <p>
                    {{ subpost.intro | md | safe }}
                </p>
            </section>
    {% endfor %}
    </div>
</section>